    "MEDICATIONS": {
      "present": true,
      "status": "content",
      "content_blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "with hepatic failure; e.g., ticarcillin (33–50 mg/kg q6–8h) combined with metronidazole (reduce conventional dose to 7.5 mg/kg IV q8–12h) and fluoroquinolone.",
          "pdf_page": 711,
          "printed_page": 629,
          "column": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Antiemetics—metoclopramide (0.2–0.5 mg/kg PO/SC q6–8h or CRI); ondansetron (0.5–1.0 mg/kg PO q12h); maropitant (1 mg/kg/day SC).",
          "pdf_page": 711,
          "printed_page": 629,
          "column": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Gastroprotection—proton pump inhibitors (omeprazole 0.5–1.0 mg/kg PO q12–24h, pantoprazole 0.7–1.0 mg/kg IV q12–24h); H2 receptor antagonists (e.g., famotidine 0.5 mg/kg PO/IV/SC q12–24h) and sucralfate (0.25–1.0 g PO q8–12h).",
          "pdf_page": 711,
          "printed_page": 629,
          "column": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Manage HE (see Hepatic Encephalopathy).",
          "pdf_page": 711,
          "printed_page": 629,
          "column": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Ursodeoxycholic acid—choleretic and hepatoprotectant (10–15 mg/kg daily in two divided doses, with food); give indefinitely if chronic hepatitis.",
          "pdf_page": 711,
          "printed_page": 629,
          "column": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Antioxidants—vitamin E (10 IU/kg/day PO),N-acetylcysteine IV (140 mg/kg load, then 70 mg/kg q8h) until PO route possible;",
          "pdf_page": 711,
          "printed_page": 629,
          "column": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "subheading",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "transition toS-adenosylmethionine (20 mg/",
          "pdf_page": 711,
          "printed_page": 629,
          "column": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "kg/day PO, dose on empty stomach) when",
          "pdf_page": 711,
          "printed_page": 629,
